  "body": "## What\n\nReal, uncommitted, unpushed local-only work discovered in the live\n`/opt/veridian/scripts` working copy while reconciling that directory to\n`origin/main` (it was 24 commits behind at time of discovery, checked out\non `fix/build-lock-liveness-guard-deploy-proof-umr20260806124537-9f47`).\nChild UMR `UMR-20260806-160208-2482`, governed by `UMR-20260806-122520-8918`,\ndispatched under `UMR-20260806-155731-f6e8`.\n\nConfirmed via `git log --all -- <path>` that neither file has any prior\ncommit history anywhere, local or remote -- genuinely new, not a duplicate\nof already-pushed work.\n\n- `session_metadata_sync.py`: rebuilds `WORK_IN_PROGRESS_METADATA.json`\n  from local `~/.claude/projects` session transcripts (file-touch +\n  completion-marker heuristics), server-side half of a laptop/server\n  session-metadata sync.\n- `sweep_awaiting_approval.py`: one-time (2026-07-31) retroactive sweep\n  applying supervisor-entrypoint.sh's (claude-control PR #118) new\n  auto-merge-on-already-approved-verdict policy to tasks that were already\n  sitting in `awaiting_human_approval` before that patch landed, reusing\n  each task's existing recorded `review.json` verdict rather than\n  re-reviewing.\n\nEverything else found modified/untracked in that same working copy was\nindependently verified redundant (byte-identical to `origin/main`, or\nalready pushed on an open PR branch -- #173, #169 -- or a known decoy/\nbackup artifact) and is intentionally NOT part of this PR.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `py_compile` clean on both files.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- [x] py_compile clean\n- [ ] Owner/CI review",
